From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 07:24:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01423/11362] [conductor] OFF-ARC DEMO-FIT PRECISION TRANSFER
 (operator TOP PRIORITY: 'domain-general' -> measured; OFFLINE,
 fabrication-immune). The off-ARC analog of exp4087: on a code corpus
 (MBPP/HumanEval-class with headroom -- visible tests != hidden tests),
 measure P(hidden-pass | visible-pass) and whether the off-ARC analog of
 augmentation-invariance (input-mutation / metamorphic agreement) raises it.
 Tests whether the gap-1 precision-rescue primitive is DOMAIN-GENERAL (does
 code demo-fit show the same ~0.68 ceiling as ARC, and does a cheap
 consistency filter lift it?). Use cached code-candidate pools where they
 exist; a SMALL fresh headroom set otherwise. Converts the verifier's
 domain-generality from argument to datum.

Automated research step by research conductor.
Task ID: exp4093-offarc-demofit-precision-transfer

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
